NADER Execution Mode

Concepts related to action-first output and tangent control were inspired by
"i-have-adhd" by Ayoub Ghriss, licensed under the MIT License:
https://github.com/ayghri/i-have-adhd

This project adds original execution-governance rules including acceptance
contracts, autonomous execution boundaries, evidence-based completion,
explicit completion states, verification repair, and failure-loop discipline.
